12
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Alice: Great. Bob, what about the security audit? We have a compliance deadline end of quarter.

13
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Bob: Right, I need to schedule that. I'll reach out to the security team and get that booked. Should be done well before end of quarter.

14
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Alice: Okay. One open question - do we need legal sign-off before we launch the new payment flow? I'm not sure who owns that.

15
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Bob: Good point. I think it's the legal team but we should confirm. Let's flag that as an open question.

16
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Priya: Also risk - if the infra issue isn't resolved by Wednesday, the migration will definitely slip past the sprint deadline.

17
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Alice: Noted. Okay let's wrap up. To summarize - Alice owns API spec by next Friday, Priya follows up with Rahul today and handles deprecation notice by end of week, Bob books the security audit before end of quarter.

18
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Bob: Sounds right. Same time next week everyone.

19
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Alice: Thanks everyone, bye.
